*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0051
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 424
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0051.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0051C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 MONTHLY-FEE        PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2200-CONCESSIONS
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "MONTHLY-FEE=" MONTHLY-FEE
    STOP RUN.
2200-CONCESSIONS.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
        WHEN STUDENT-FLAG = 'Y'
           AND CUST-AGE < 24
            MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
            MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
        WHEN CUST-AGE NOT < 65
            MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
            MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 4 TO MONTHLY-FEE
    END-EVALUATE.
